```jsEval
@slots heavyRain, highRiver, floodedSquare, marketClose
@facts heavyRain → highRiver AND unclosedGate → floodedSquare
@answer jsEval(
  (time) => {
    // Cross-domain check: at what time does the team finish?
    const finishTime = time + 2;
    // Rule changes:
    // heavyRain → highRiver AND unclosedGate → floodedSquare
    // highRiver AND unclosedGate → floodedSquare → marketClose
    // floodedSquare → marketClose → marketClose
    return `@answer ${finishTime}`;
  }
);
```

